<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24591" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-trĕmo</span></b> , ŭi,
		3, v. n. and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i>to tremble</i>, <i>shake</i>, <i>quake</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">totum corpus intremit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 3,
					3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnem Murmure Trinacriam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 3, 581</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intremuit malus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 5, 505</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tellus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					1, 284</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quercus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 7, 629</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genua intremuere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 10, 458</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">2, 180: quo (clamore) intremuere undae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 3, 672</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to tremble at</i> or <i>before</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regum eventus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil. 8,
					60</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hannibalem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					16, 664</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
